bluejetty:00187132:ios.description:
Turn a simple scan into perfect results - SCAN ACE
Every file and image is consistently captured with clear, high-quality results.
Trusted by millions of users worldwide for over a decade.
SCAN ACE PROVIDES ALL THE TOOLS FOR DOCUMENTS:
FULL FEATURE SCANNER
- Automatically detects document edges with no manual angle adjustment required;
- Supports Document, ID Card, Passport scan modes, and image to PDF conversion for different needs;
- Provides the option to select page size when exporting documents;
- Supports JPG, PDF, and image to PDF file formats for sharing
ALL IN ONE PDF DOCUMENT EDITOR
- Recognizes text in over 20 languages with AI OCR and supports content copying;
- Professional filters including Color, Black & White, Photo, Grayscale;
- Draw or scan a signature directly into documents;
- Highlight important information with a marker.
- Add a watermark to documents for protection or labeling.
MANAGE & SHARE PDF
- Add a password to PDF documents to keep them secure;
- Send documents by fax or email, save to files, or upload to Google Drive, OneDrive, Box, and Dropbox;
- Adjust PDF pages to reorder, delete, or rotate them;
- Convert files to PDF or search PDF documents by keywords to quickly find what you need
SUBSCRIPTION DETAILS
- Weekly and annual subscriptions are available. 
- Payment will be charged to your iTunes account at confirmation of purchase. 
- Your subscription will automatically renew unless auto-renew is disabled at least 24 hours before the end of the current subscription period. 
- Automatic renewals will be charged at the same price you were originally charged for the subscription. 
- Subscriptions can be managed by going to Account Settings on the App Store after purchase. 
SCAN ACE is regularly updated with new features and improvements. If you encounter any issues, please contact us before leaving a review. We are always ready to help and guide you through using the app.
If you have a problem or suggestion, please email support@neopixel.biz. You will receive a timely response and solution.
Terms of Service: https://neopixel.ai/SCAN-ACE/terms 
Privacy Policy: https://neopixel.ai/SCAN-ACE/privacy

